OL,3,GNEWSATransatlantic slavery victims
OL,4,Aremembered in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims of transatlantic slavery will
OL,7,Fbe remembered in London with a series
OL,8,Fof walking tours, exhibitions and
OL,9,Fresearch.
OL,11,FTen organisations across nine boroughs
OL,12,Fwill each receive up to #10,000 to help
OL,13,Fthem establish the memorials, which
OL,14,Fwill be linked to The Wake.
OL,16,FPlanning permission for the near-7m
OL,17,F(23ft) bronze cowrie shell sculpture
OL,18,Fwas granted this month, and will stand
OL,19,Fon West India Quay in Docklands.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
